# ============================================
# GitHub Specific
# ============================================

# NOTE: *.github was deliberately removed from here (RC1 readiness review) — as a glob
# pattern it matches the literal path ".github", which silently excluded the entire
# .github/workflows/ directory (ci.yml AND deploy.yml) from version control since this
# file's very first commit. Neither workflow has ever actually been on GitHub or run.
*.workflow

