# ============================================
# Deployment secrets (Phase 17)
# ============================================
# The Demo database password lives in a single root `.env` (already covered by the
# `.env` / `.env.*` / `!.env.example` rules above — Docker Compose's own auto-discovered
# default env file, see .env.example and deploy/RUNBOOK.md). Nothing deploy-specific needed
# here for that anymore — deliberately NOT deploy/postgres-demo.env, which duplicated this
# and was a real source of drift (see deploy/RUNBOOK.md "Recovering a server...").
#
# Personal document — see deploy/sites/aryanb.dev/RESUME_PLACEHOLDER.md (uploaded straight
# to the server's shared/ dir instead, never through git).
deploy/sites/aryanb.dev/resume.pdf

# Local backup copy (not tracked; see conversation for why)
bkp/

# Claude Code local session/config data — machine-specific, not part of the app.
.claude/
